@startuml DatabaseDesign

hide circle
hide methods

top to bottom direction

skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam nodesep 8
skinparam ranksep 12
skinparam padding 1
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor White
  HeaderBackgroundColor #D4E6F1
  BorderColor #5B9BD5
  FontSize 10
  AttributeFontSize 9
}

